{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38587","headline":"池上双凫二首 一 · 吴融","name":"池上双凫二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧池悠漾小凫雏，两两依依秪自娱。\n钓艇忽移还散去，寒鸱有意即相呼。\n可怜翡翠归云髻，莫羡鸳鸯入画图。\n幸是羽毛无取处，一生安稳老菰蒲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}